+        "and the provider failure cause remains NOT_EXPOSED. This section does not "
+        "promote current CI or product readiness.",
+        "",
+        "| # | Scope | Source binding | Run and provider observations | Evidence |",
+        "| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |",
+        *rows,
+        "",
